{
  "tool_name": "search_kg",
  "tool_role": "R0a: Entity Grounding / Knowledge Resolution",
  "domain": [
    "generic"
  ],
  "task_type": "retrieval",
  "input_semantics": [
    {
      "field": "entity_name",
      "semantic_type": "dsl_slot",
      "description": "SLOT: entity_name | TYPE: string | ENUM: null | REQUIRED: true\nMEANING: ENTITY.NAME | 补充：当查询实体组（如'美股半导体三巨头'）时，返回结果的members字段包含所有成员实体，必须遍历该列表进行后续处理，禁止硬编码成员名称 | 注意：比较题需遍历全members再结论 | 注意：遍历后继续查日期并比较",
      "required": true
    }
  ],
  "output_semantics": [
    {
      "field": "id",
      "semantic_type": "identifier",
      "description": "Entity ID"
    },
    {
      "field": "aliases",
      "semantic_type": "list",
      "description": "List of aliases"
    },
    {
      "field": "description",
      "semantic_type": "metadata",
      "description": "Description of the entity"
    },
    {
      "field": "region",
      "semantic_type": "metadata",
      "description": "Region of the entity"
    },
    {
      "field": "count",
      "semantic_type": "value",
      "description": "Number of members"
    },
    {
      "field": "members",
      "semantic_type": "list",
      "description": "List of members"
    }
  ],
  "produces": [
    "entity_record"
  ],
  "consumes": [
    "entity_name",
    "kg_file_path"
  ],
  "error_model": {
    "observability": "return_schema",
    "error_types": [
      "invalid_parameter",
      "empty_result",
      "internal_exception"
    ],
    "error_surface": "return_field",
    "notes": "Handles errors using try-except blocks."
  },
  "examples": {
    "parameter_template": {
      "entity_name": "AAPL",
      "kg_file_path": "/data/financial_kg.json"
    },
    "return_shape_example": {
      "id": "AAPL",
      "aliases": [
        "Apple Inc.",
        "AAPL"
      ],
      "description": "Apple Inc. is an American multinational technology company that specializes in consumer electronics, software, and online services.",
      "region": "US",
      "count": 5,
      "members": [
        "Tim Cook",
        "Luca Maestri",
        "Jeff Williams",
        "Katherine Adams",
        "Eddy Cue"
      ],
      "error": {
        "type": "invalid_parameter",
        "message": "The entity name provided does not exist in the knowledge graph."
      }
    }
  },
  "description": "SELECT ENTITY_MEMBERSHIP\nFROM GENERIC\nWHERE ENTITY = <entity_name>\n  AND KG_SOURCE = <kg_file_path>\n[CONSTRAINT] When the result contains a 'members' field, you MUST:\n1. Iterate through ALL members (not just the first one)\n2. Call price/data tools for EACH member separately\n3. When computing average: sum all values (treat None/failed as 0) THEN divide by result.count (total member count), NOT by number of successful fetches\n[EXAMPLE] For 三大运营商 (count=3): get prices for 中国移动, 中国电信, 中国联通 individually, then avg = (p1+p2+p3)/3",
  "tool_alternative": [],
  "tool_dependencies": [],
